   CLAUDE.md §3 ("demo/ScreenB — exam model/question distribution demo,
   mock data, uses the shared library only"). Same additive-route pattern
   demo/ScreenA/SyncStatus.razor already established.

   NAMING — page purpose, not literal transliteration: the real nav-linked
   stub for this area is Pages/QuizsModels.razor ("قوالب الاختبارات" ->
   "/quizs-models", currently an empty "@page" stub, same status as
